{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06592","headline":"巩城东庄道中作 · 储光羲","name":"巩城东庄道中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北陵散寒鸟，西山照初日。\n婉娈晋阳京，踟蹰野人室。\n南轩草间去，後乘林中出。\n霭霭长路暖，迟迟狭路归。\n蜉蝣时蔽月，枳棘复伤衣。\n城上东风起，河边早雁飞。\n夏王纪冬令，殷人乃正月。\n涯口度新云，山阴留故雪。\n幸逢耆耋话，余待亲隣别。\n总辔出丛薄，歇鞍登峻隅。\n春源既荡漭，伏战亦睢盱。\n未获遵平道，徒言信薄夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}